// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PLACEHOLDER: Facebook Page Post
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Requires: pages_manage_posts permission approved in Meta App Review
//
// When ready, replace with:
//   - HTTP Request to https://graph.facebook.com/v18.0/{page-id}/feed
//   - Auth: Page Access Token (long-lived, from Meta)
//   - Body: { message: caption, link: 'https://youtu.be/' + youtubeId }
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

const song = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.song;
const queueItem = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.queueItem;
const youtubeId = $('Upload to YouTube1').first().json.id;
console.log('TODO: Post to Facebook for song:', song.slug, '| YouTube:', youtubeId);

return [{ json: { queueItem, song, youtubeId, fbPosted: false, fbSkipped: true } }];

const slug = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.song.slug;
const files = $input.first().json.files || [];
if (!files.length) {
  throw new Error(`video_en.mp4 not found in Drive folder for slug '${slug}'. Upload it to husariabeats-releases/${slug}/video_en.mp4`);
}
return [{ json: { videoEnFileId: files[0].id, slug } }];

// Parse meta.json and build YouTube upload context for both PL and EN.
// Required meta.json fields:
//   title_pl, title_en         — YouTube video titles
//   description_pl             — Polish description
//   description_en             — English description
//   tags_pl, tags_en           — YouTube tags arrays

const song = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.song;
const queueItem = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.queueItem;
const videoFileId = $('Extract Video File ID1').first().json.videoFileId;
const folderId = $('Extract Folder ID1').first().json.folderId;

let meta;
try {
  meta = JSON.parse($input.first().json.data);
} catch(e) {
  throw new Error(`meta.json is not valid JSON: ${e.message}`);
}

// Validate required PL fields
if (!meta.title_pl) throw new Error('meta.json missing: title_pl');
if (!meta.description_pl) throw new Error('meta.json missing: description_pl');
if (!meta.tags_pl || !meta.tags_pl.length) throw new Error('meta.json missing: tags_pl (array)');

// Validate required EN fields
if (!meta.title_en) throw new Error('meta.json missing: title_en');
if (!meta.description_en) throw new Error('meta.json missing: description_en');
if (!meta.tags_en || !meta.tags_en.length) throw new Error('meta.json missing: tags_en (array)');

// Build PL upload data
const descPlParts = [meta.description_pl];
const descPl = descPlParts.join('\n\n');
const tagsPl = Array.isArray(meta.tags_pl) ? meta.tags_pl.join(',') : meta.tags_pl;

// Build EN upload data
const descEnParts = [meta.description_en];
const descEn = descEnParts.join('\n\n');

// Optional album playlist fields
const albumNamePl = meta.album_name_pl || null;
const albumNameEn = meta.album_name_en || null;
const tagsEn = Array.isArray(meta.tags_en) ? meta.tags_en.join(',') : meta.tags_en;

return [{ json: {
  videoFileId, folderId,
  titlePl: meta.title_pl, descriptionPl: descPl, tagsPl,
  titleEn: meta.title_en, descriptionEn: descEn, tagsEn,
  song, queueItem,
  albumNamePl, albumNameEn
} }];

// Extract meta.json file ID. Throw if missing — meta.json is required.
const slug = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.song.slug;
const videoFileId = $('Extract Video File ID1').first().json.videoFileId;
const files = $input.first().json.files || [];
if (!files.length) {
  throw new Error(`meta.json not found in Drive folder for slug '${slug}'. Create husariabeats-releases/${slug}/meta.json with title_pl, description_pl, description_en, tags fields.`);
}
return [{ json: { metaFileId: files[0].id, videoFileId, slug } }];

// Extract video file ID. Also carry folderId forward for meta.json search.
const slug = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.song.slug;
const folderId = $('Extract Folder ID1').first().json.folderId;
const files = $input.first().json.files || [];
if (!files.length) {
  throw new Error(`video_pl.mp4 not found in Drive folder for slug '${slug}'. Upload it to husariabeats-releases/${slug}/video_pl.mp4`);
}
return [{ json: { videoFileId: files[0].id, folderId, slug } }];

// Extract folder ID from Drive search result
const slug = $('Extract Song Details1').first().json.song.slug;
const files = $input.first().json.files || [];
if (!files.length) {
  throw new Error(`Drive folder '${slug}' not found in husariabeats-releases. Create folder husariabeats-releases/${slug}/ and upload video.mp4 + meta.json.`);
}
return [{ json: { folderId: files[0].id, slug } }];

// Find the specific song from the queue item
// n8n splits array HTTP response into individual items — use $input.all()
// DB column is song_id (not song_slug)
const queueItem = $('Restore Queue Item1').first().json.item;
const songs = $input.all().map(i => i.json);
const songId = queueItem.song_id || queueItem.song_slug;
const song = songs.find(s => s.slug === songId);

if (!song) {
  throw new Error(`Song '${songId}' not found in songs list`);
}

return [{ json: { queueItem, song } }];

// Re-surfaces the queue item after the kill-switch IF branch
const item = $('Find Today\'s Release1').first().json.item;
return [{ json: { item } }];

// Filter for queued items scheduled today (Warsaw time)
// n8n splits array HTTP response into individual items — iterate directly
const today = new Date().toLocaleDateString('sv-SE', { timeZone: 'Europe/Warsaw' });
const items = $input.all();

const todayItem = items
  .map(i => i.json)
  .find(e => {
    const scheduledDate = e.scheduled_at ? String(e.scheduled_at).substring(0, 10) : null;
    return e.status === 'queued' && scheduledDate === today;
  });

if (!todayItem) {
  return [{ json: { hasItem: false } }];
}
return [{ json: { hasItem: true, item: todayItem } }];

// Fetch album playlist IDs from husariabeats DB API
// Uses album_name_pl from meta.json as album key (slug derived from song's album_slug)
const albumNamePl = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.albumNamePl;
if (!albumNamePl) return []; // no album defined, skip

const song = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.song;
const albumSlug = song.album_slug;
if (!albumSlug) return []; // song not linked to album in DB, skip

// albumSlug is used as DB key; albumNamePl used as playlist title if creating
return [{ json: {
  albumSlug,
  albumNamePl,
  videoId: $input.first().json.id
} }];

// Fetch album playlist IDs from husariabeats DB API
const albumNameEn = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.albumNameEn;
const song = $('Parse meta.json1').first().json.song;
const albumSlug = song.album_slug;
if (!albumSlug || !albumNameEn) return [];

return [{ json: {
  albumSlug,
  albumNameEn,
  videoId: $input.first().json.id
} }];
